 "segments": [
  {
   "id": "seg-01",
   "spk": "Alex",
   "en": "Today I run a small program, and it works. The program is new to me. Maria shows me the command. I point to the commit. I look at the commit message. I hear, \"What time is it?\" then I answer, \"What time works for you?\" I learn one new thing.",
   "tts": "Today I run a small program, and it works. The program is new to me. Maria shows me the command. I point to the commit. I look at the commit message. I hear, \"What time is it?\" then I answer, \"What time works for you?\" I learn one new thing.",
   "audio_file": "audio/seg-01.mp3",
   "zh": "今天我运行了一个小程序，它成功了。程序对我来说很新。Maria 给我看了命令。我指着提交。我看着提交说明。我听到：\"现在几点？\"然后我回答：\"什么时间对你方便？\"我学到了一件新东西。",
   "hard": [
    {
     "w": "program",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "程序，让电脑执行任务的一组指令"
    },
    {
     "w": "command",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "命令，告诉电脑立即执行某个操作的文字"
    },
    {
     "w": "What time is it?",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "现在几点？"
    },
    {
     "w": "What time works for you?",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "什么时间对你方便？"
    },
    {
     "w": "commit",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "提交，保存一组有意义的代码变化"
    },
    {
     "w": "commit message",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "提交说明，解释本次提交修改了什么"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "seg-02",
   "spk": "Alex",
   "en": "At lunch, we talk about the time for a short meeting. I say the new pattern twice: I'm available at ... I read the pattern slowly: Let's meet at ... I run a program with Maria. I execute code. I save a snapshot slowly. I see the commit history. Maria helps me a lot.",
   "tts": "At lunch, we talk about the time for a short meeting. I say the new pattern twice: I'm available at  I read the pattern slowly: Let's meet at  I run a program with Maria. I execute code. I save a snapshot slowly. I see the commit history. Maria helps me a lot.",
   "audio_file": "audio/seg-02.mp3",
   "zh": "午饭时，我们讨论了一个短会的时间。我把新句型读了两遍：我在……有时间。我慢慢读出这个句型：我们……见吧。我和 Maria 一起运行程序。我执行代码。我慢慢保存快照。我看到了提交历史。Maria 帮了我很多。",
   "hard": [
    {
     "w": "run a program",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "运行程序，让电脑开始执行程序指令"
    },
    {
     "w": "execute code",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "执行代码，让代码真正产生结果"
    },
    {
     "w": "I'm available at ...",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "我在……有时间。"
    },
    {
     "w": "Let's meet at ...",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "我们……见吧。"
    },
    {
     "w": "save a snapshot",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "保存快照，记录项目在某一时刻的状态"
    },
    {
     "w": "commit history",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "提交历史，按时间保存的历次代码变化"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "seg-03",
   "spk": "Alex",
   "en": "Before I leave, I do one last thing. The commit hash is new to me. Maria asks me to make a commit. I point to the output. I stop a process. I hear, \"I'm running late.\" then I answer, \"See you tomorrow.\" Before I leave, I save my first commit. My name is in the history now.",
   "tts": "Before I leave, I do one last thing. The commit hash is new to me. Maria asks me to make a commit. I point to the output. I stop a process. I hear, \"I'm running late.\" then I answer, \"See you tomorrow.\" Before I leave, I save my first commit. My name is in the history now.",
   "audio_file": "audio/seg-03.mp3",
   "zh": "离开前，我做最后一件事。提交哈希对我来说很新。Maria 让我创建提交。我指着输出。我停止进程。我听到：\"我要迟到了。\"然后我回答：\"明天见。\"离开前，我保存了第一次提交。我的名字现在进入了历史记录。",
   "hard": [
    {
     "w": "output",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "输出，程序处理后给出的结果"
    },
    {
     "w": "stop a process",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "停止进程，让正在运行的任务结束"
    },
    {
     "w": "I'm running late.",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "我要迟到了。"
    },
    {
     "w": "See you tomorrow.",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "明天见。"
    },
    {
     "w": "commit hash",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "提交哈希，用来唯一识别某次提交的字符串"
    },
    {
     "w": "make a commit",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "创建提交，把当前选中的变化记入历史"
    }
   ]
  }
